    "warnings": [
      "The selected model’s docstring says the type measures have positive densities, but its definition requires the restricted Lebesgue measure to be absolutely continuous with respect to each type measure, not that the type measures have densities. The metadata and README correctly say no density is required. This could lead readers to mistake the theorem for a narrower claim; revise the docstring to describe the actual measure assumptions."
